  <item>
    <title>037-2025将是明亮积极自信的一年</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/678c5d2bfd3865236603c841</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">678c5d2bfd3865236603c841</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 19 Jan 2025 19:30:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="71">01:11</a> 写三年日记（or五年日记）的乐趣；</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="338">05:38</a> 感到一种命运的推背感，2025年会非常非常好；</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="529">08:49</a> 发莉：2024是不断做事的一年；</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="653">10:53</a> 一开始以为是运气，后来发现是实力；</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="727">12:07</a> 粽粽：2024年是跟人吵架断交的一年；</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="931">15:31</a> 过情关；</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="964">16:04</a> 逾越有的时候是因为有了更大的目标；</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1052">17:32</a> 发莉：发起心想事成俱乐部；</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1545">25:45</a> 粽粽：大 i 开始可以沉浸于直播了；</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1780">29:40</a> 粽粽：25年的课题是如何带教 P 人；</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1841">30:41</a> 发莉：让它发生~~</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2221">37:01</a> 19年分享给发莉的笔记法；</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2463">41:03</a> 如何拯救我的表妹一家???</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2782">46:22</a> 掌握物理学上的势能动能，更有概率把日子过好；</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2829">47:09</a> 夸夸趁早，弥合学术界与大众之间的代沟；</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2938">48:58</a> 非常幸运在趁早工作；</span></p><span></span><p><span>&nbsp;</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/629ff6d61de593f991218b12/ls2E3QhJMoQ-enRw6EG-adCR_hoR.m4a" length="49023248" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:50:31</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FhDO8UO9HY5SgycU1FXubL01yQgB.png"/>
    <itunes:episode>37</itunes:episode>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>035-成为职场搭子是因为：都学过PMP</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/669c9faa8fcadceb90ca2af2</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">669c9faa8fcadceb90ca2af2</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 21 Jul 2024 05:42:01 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="44">00:44</a> 在框架中追求职场自由</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="92">01:32</a> 九年后，活儿终于能传下去了</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="309">05:09</a> 复盘日结</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="402">06:42</a> 保护好自己的优先级</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="475">07:55</a> 更新自己的SOP</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="670">11:10</a> 新体验：同时带三个完全不一样的实习生</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="910">15:10</a> 新人的一个槛：不敢与老板沟通</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1073">17:53</a> 有善意的领导带新人 be like</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1240">20:40</a> 新人做旧事儿，老人找新事儿</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1524">25:24</a> 复盘日结 round 2</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1594">26:34</a> 俩人巴掌拍在一起，能成为职场搭子很重要的原因</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1977">32:57</a> “我只能继续这样滚下去”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2099">34:59</a> 对发莉来说，转动命运齿轮的事件：生育</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2166">36:06</a> 高光时刻是什么？</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lsVJ_Hc55z3Vy-xe5adgf0d3XusR.m4a" length="37442505" type="audio/mp4"/>
