    <guid isPermaLink="false">6687ef5a0bc5d7cc70193c01</guid>
    <pubDate>Fri, 05 Jul 2024 13:04:24 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="39">00:39</a> 2023年的7月9日，决定和老板聊一次；</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="132">02:12</a> 工作冲突始末；</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="349">05:49</a> 冲突解决后并翻篇儿（并不再祥林嫂式反复诉说）是很重要的；</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="356">05:56</a> 变得非常擅长于绝交；</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="576">09:36</a> 经过冲突后的情谊vs虚假的友好；</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="695">11:35</a> 好好安放自己的需求；</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="835">13:55</a> “拒绝”是一种需要学习的能力；</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="917">15:17</a> 忐忑的年度体检；</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1315">21:55</a> 写下来的愿望会更慎重对待；</span></p>]]></description>
