  <item>
    <title>034-消失的女性，我们竟然都不知道外婆的名字</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6618f41348c40e2fb0e16fc4</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6618f41348c40e2fb0e16fc4</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 14 Apr 2024 08:30:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="55">00:55</a> 对女性来说绕不开的生育课题；</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="194">03:14</a> 进入生育阶段，是对婚姻考验的开始；</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="315">05:15</a> 多子女家庭中的长姐如母；</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="418">06:58</a> "好像该生孩子了"；</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="496">08:16</a> 莫晚：31之后开始认真思考要不要生；</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="573">09:33</a> 生与不生，这个选择是相斥的；</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="695">11:35</a> 婚礼上的闹剧：孩子随谁家姓之争；</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1053">17:33</a> 和父母之间闭口不聊婚育话题；</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1239">20:39</a> 浙江独生女：我一定要比男性更强；</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1375">22:55</a> 消失的女性，我们竟然都不知道外婆的名字；</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1608">26:48</a> 多子女家庭中感受到的重男轻女；&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2065">34:25</a> 从我做起，老了以后做有界限的老人； &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/luyGAGTY3XJmuMAg8pJFtlq6bYFw.m4a" length="40203730" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:41:25</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://bts-image.xyzcdn.net/aHR0cHM6Ly9pbWFnZS54eXpjZG4ubmV0L0ZtSUxheXpROE1GVHpZRFFlb2pGYXczd255cmcucG5n.png"/>
    <itunes:episode>34</itunes:episode>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>033-三头追逐胡萝卜的驴</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/65f6504d696bd9a8799d2186</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">65f6504d696bd9a8799d2186</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 17 Mar 2024 08:30:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="49">00:49</a> 这一期的嘉宾双双：从同事变成前同事；</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="421">07:01</a> 为什么选择离职；</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="636">10:36</a> 从雀跃入职到怅然离职，这中间什么变化了？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="737">12:17</a> 发莉的观点：身心不合一了；</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="862">14:22</a> 追逐🥕：工作的意义感；</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1081">18:01</a> 放大景别，追逐下一根🥕；</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1197">19:57</a> 农夫和土地：有付出就有哪怕一丁点的收获；</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1355">22:35</a> 现代农夫：收获字节与数据；&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1404">23:24</a> 确定性vs不确定性之间的平衡；</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1523">25:23</a> 被程序员他律的厌恶；</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1771">29:31</a> 水至清也有鱼；</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1831">30:31</a> 推荐《凯洛的末日日常》；</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2135">35:35</a> 意愿度vs能力；</span></p><span></span><p><span>&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span>&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/ltvbGxGuv4_9QJrmX8Z8SevNK2D3.m4a" length="37859743" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:39:00</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://bts-image.xyzcdn.net/aHR0cHM6Ly9pbWFnZS54eXpjZG4ubmV0L0Z1Nkp1SW05Q3BQNTI2VHpKeExOTE5IMHFiU2EucG5n.png"/>
