  <item>
    <title>032-工作12年看明白了，运势的本质是人的交互</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/65d8aae80847349e0c9190d5</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">65d8aae80847349e0c9190d5</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 25 Feb 2024 08:30:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="65">01:05</a> 在凤凰寺过年；</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="268">04:28</a> 已经工作十二年了；</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="363">06:03</a> 努力工作的终极目标是获得更多支配时间的自由；</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="526">08:46</a> 趁早寺？（误</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="642">10:42</a> 重复践行你认为对的事情；</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="935">15:35</a> 为了拉起状态打算做的三件事情；</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1072">17:52</a> 双向夸夸局；</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1477">24:37</a> 运势的本质是人的交互；</span></p>]]></description>
